                                                                       <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/definitionSource> "GPT-4 generated description with manual adjustments" .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Intermetallic
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Intermetallic> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Phase> ;
                                                                  rdfs:label "Intermetallic"@en ;
                                                                  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A type of metallic compound, typically ordered, that is composed of two or more metallic elements. Intermetallic compounds exhibit crystal structures which deviate from the ones of the contained metals and  ionic or covalent bonding forces can act as well aside from the metallic bond. " ;
                                                                  <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/definitionSource> "GPT-4 generated description with manual adjustments" .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/InterstitialAtom
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/InterstitialAtom> rdf:type owl:Class ;
