                                                                       <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/definitionSource> "GPT-4 generated description with manual adjustments" .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/KinematicHardening
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/KinematicHardening> rdf:type owl:Class ;
