###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Martensite
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Martensite> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                               rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/Microstructure> ;
                                                               rdfs:label "Martensite"@en ;
                                                               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Martensite is a microstructure formed after quenching at fast cooling rates where the ferritic consituents are arranged in a hierarchical manner, additionally carbides and retained austenite are often present."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/MartensiteAusteniteIsland
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/MartensiteAusteniteIsland> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                              rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/MicrostructureEntity> ,
                                                                                              [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
