                                                                     rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/co/ValueObject> ,
                                                                                     <https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/UseCaseMaterialsMechanics> ;
                                                                     rdfs:label "Physical quantity"@en ;
                                                                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A physical quantity is a property of a material or system that can be quantified by measurement. A physical quantity can be expressed as a value that is composed of a numerical value and optionally a measurement unit."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/PhysicallyShortCrack
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/PhysicallyShortCrack> rdf:type owl:Class ;
