                                                                    rdfs:label "Quenching medium"@en ;
                                                                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "These parameters describe the specimen geometry. They are determined / measured after the machining process is finished and specified before the machining process. The specimen after machining is input for the mechanical testing subprocess."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/RambergOsgoodCyclicHardeningExponent
