###  https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/StressRatio
<https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/StressRatio> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                                rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/pmd/materials-mechanics-ontology/MechanicalTestParameter> ;
                                                                rdfs:label "R ratio"@en ;
                                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Stress ratio"@en ;
                                                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> """Relation of S_min to S_max (R = S_min / S_max). 
0 < R < 1 describes tension-tension loading,
R = 0 describes pulsating stress (S_m = S_a = S_max), 
-1 < R < 0 describes partly reversed tension-compression loading,
R = -1 describes fully reversed loading, 
-\"infinte\" < R < -1 describes partly reversed compression  loading,
R = -\"infinite\" is compression pulsating stress,
R > 1 describes compression-compression loading"""@en .


